{"spec": "v1", "title": "圆锥摆：小球在水平面内做匀速圆周运动", "view": "3d", "stem": "长 L = 1 m 的轻绳一端固定，小球在水平面内做匀速圆周运动，绳与竖直方向成 θ = 37°。g = 10 m/s²。求角速度 ω。", "constants": {"g": 10}, "params": {"L": [1, "m", "绳长"], "th": [0.6435, "rad", "绳与竖直方向夹角 37°"]}, "scene": {"surfaces": [], "bodies": [], "script": {"duration": "2*2*pi/sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))", "bodies": {"小球": {"x": "L*sin(th)*cos(sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))*t)", "y": "-L*cos(th)", "z": "L*sin(th)*sin(sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))*t)", "kind": "ball", "m": 1}}, "links": [{"a": [0, 0, 0], "b": "小球"}], "curves": [{"x": "L*sin(th)*cos(2*pi*u)", "y": "-L*cos(th)", "z": "L*sin(th)*sin(2*pi*u)"}], "vectors": [{"on": "小球", "v": [0, "-g", 0], "label": "mg"}, {"on": "小球", "v": ["-g*tan(th)*cos(sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))*t)", "g", "-g*tan(th)*sin(sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))*t)"], "label": "T"}, {"on": "小球", "v": ["-g*tan(th)*cos(sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))*t)", 0, "-g*tan(th)*sin(sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))*t)"], "label": "F合"}]}}, "asks": [{"id": "1", "text": "角速度 ω", "answer": "sqrt(g/(L*cos(th)))", "unit": "rad/s"}], "idea": "小球在水平面内转，合力指向圆心，由绳的拉力和重力合成。", "solution": {"1": [{"say": "竖直方向：绳的拉力的竖直分量和重力平衡；水平方向：拉力的水平分量就是合力，指向圆心，提供向心力。", "tex": "T\\cos\\theta=mg,\\quad T\\sin\\theta=m\\omega^2L\\sin\\theta"}, {"say": "消去 $T$。", "tex": "\\omega=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{g}{L\\cos\\theta}}"}]}}